; Characterization: a bare number in a period expression lexes as a
; day (TOK_INT), and a month name as TOK_A_MONTH.  These blocks pass
; with or without string_to_month_of_year's digit arms, which the
; lexer never reaches; the source grep in the review step is the
; check for their removal.

2024/11/11 Payee
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test period --now 2024/06/15 "11"
--- Period expression tokens ---
TOK_INT: 11
END_REACHED: <EOF>

--- Before stabilization ---
   range: in day 11

--- After stabilization ---
   range: in day 11
   start: 24-Jan-11
  finish: 24-Jan-12

--- Sample dates in range (max. 20) ---
 1: 24-Jan-11
end test

test period --now 2024/06/15 "november"
--- Period expression tokens ---
TOK_A_MONTH: Nov
END_REACHED: <EOF>

--- Before stabilization ---
   range: in month Nov

--- After stabilization ---
   range: in month Nov
   start: 23-Nov-01
  finish: 23-Dec-01

--- Sample dates in range (max. 20) ---
 1: 23-Nov-01
end test
